<Base title="About Us | TheWorthScout"><article class="wrap prose"><div class="eyebrow">About TheWorthScout</div><h1>Research before recommendations.</h1><p>TheWorthScout is an independent editorial project focused on helping readers make more informed purchasing decisions. We are starting with pet-related guides and may expand into other categories over time.</p><p>Our goal is to make product information easier to understand, including important trade-offs and limitations. We do not claim hands-on testing unless it has actually taken place.</p><p>We may earn commissions from qualifying purchases through affiliate links. Those relationships should not determine our editorial conclusions.</p></article></Base>
